  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La tarde de este s&aacute;bado se ha iniciado en la Font de Dins una nueva edici&oacute;n de &#39;Onda, Espais de Jazz&#39;, con la actuaci&oacute;n de la cantante castellonense B&aacute;rbara Breva, acompa&ntilde;ada por un cuarteto de la Big Band local, con Manolo D&iacute;az a la trompeta, Joan Fonfria a la guitara el&eacute;ctrica, C&eacute;sar Cort&eacute;s al contrabajo y Rub&eacute;n Franch a la bater&iacute;a.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0423.jpg\" alt=\"img_0423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0424.jpg\" alt=\"img_0424\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0426.jpg\" alt=\"img_0426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0427.jpg\" alt=\"img_0427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0428.jpg\" alt=\"img_0428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0431.jpg\" alt=\"img_0431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0432.jpg\" alt=\"img_0432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quartetbigbandbarbarabrevajazzfontdins14/img_0433.jpg\" alt=\"img_0433\" style=\"m